# Ops loop

You are working in a git-tracked Obsidian vault at `ops/` — the company OS.

- Start from `ops/HOME.md` and `ops/BOARD.md` (regenerate with `python3 ops/scripts/board_sync.py`).
- Roles: planner writes `ops/plans/`. Implementer opens a PR. Reviewer comments only — never merge.
- One ticket per session. Skip `type: epic`. Prefix `WF-` = workflow. `PRD-` = product. `INC-` = incident.
- New tickets: `python3 ops/scripts/new_ticket.py`. Naming: `ops/NAMING.md`. Roster: `ops/agents/_index.md`.
- No Jenkins. No prod writes. No secrets in notes.
- Full loop: `ops/workflow/LOOP.md`. Safety: `ops/workflow/SAFETY.md`.
- Do not implement product unless `PRD-*` and `status: implement`.
